The .oplx file format is described in this repository from observable
behavior of OmniPlan 4.10.2. The format itself is not copyrighted; this
spec describes it for interoperability purposes. OmniPlan and The Omni
Group are trademarks of The Omni Group; this spec is not affiliated
with or endorsed by The Omni Group.
